Supported Second Sight Video ModesThis is the list of supported Second Sight video modes (as of thenext general ROM release - the 32K color modes weren't supportedby the first EPROM Rev.) This table assumes you're using the VGALib'vgaSetMode' command, since some of these mode tables are only inthe library, and not in ROM.0x01		40x25 Text	VGA, RGB0x03		80x25 Text	VGA, RGB0x13		320x200x256	VGA, RGB0x53		640x480x256	VGA0x5C		640x480x32K	VGA0x61		640x400x256	VGA, RGB0x70		320x200x32K	VGA(The following modes are on supported on VGA and RGV monitors)0xFA		560x192x16		(DHires)0xFB		280x192x16		(Hires)0xFC		40x240xFD		80x240xFE		640x200	(SHR, LoRes)